Open 2 terminal;
use the command "make";
In the first terminal, run "make qemu_debug" to start QEMU in debug mode;
In the second terminal, run "make gdb_start".
In GBD, use the command "target remote localhost:1234" to connect to QEMU;
Use "break" + "function_name" to set a breakpoint at the function selected before, then "continue" to start execution.
Then, use the command "continue" or "step" to step through the code and observe the behavior of the scheduler and tasks.